status: published
title: Snooze until the customer replies
date: 2026-10-05
author: Maya Chen
categories:
  - improved
excerpt: A new snooze option keeps waiting conversations out of your queue until there's news.
---

Waiting on a customer? Snooze a conversation *until they reply* and it leaves your queue. If they haven't answered in a week, Relay brings it back with a gentle nudge.
